 "summary": "Nine single Schottky barrier rectifiers in the SMA (DO-214AC) surface-mount package, all rated 3.0 A average forward current and 80 A surge. They differ in reverse voltage, from 20 V (SS32) to 200 V (SS320); the SS310 blocks 100 V. Forward drop at 3 A rises with the voltage rating, from 0.55 V to 0.95 V maximum. Intended uses are high-speed switching, circuit protection and voltage clamping.",
